  lines:
  - english: The station board is readable again. We can prepare the evacuation train.
    vietnamese: "B\u1EA3ng ga \u0111\xE3 r\xF5 ch\u1EEF tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i. Ch\xFAng
      t\xF4i c\xF3 th\u1EC3 chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB chuy\u1EBFn t\xE0u s\u01A1 t\xE1n."
  - english: Before you leave, speak to the man in gray on the right of the station.
    vietnamese: "Tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi \u0111i, h\xE3y g\u1EB7p ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \xE1o
      x\xE1m b\xEAn ph\u1EA3i s\xE2n ga."
